    {
      "id": "riv-ferryman",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 2650,
      "speaker": "Ferryman",
      "lines": [
        "Crossing's closed till the water drops. Two days, maybe three.",
        "There's a camp on the bank — everyone waiting, same as you. Some have been there a season.",
        "Cold night to be standing about. You'll want to go down and find a fire."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Ask who's waiting there",
        "Pay for a crossing now",
        "Go down to the camp"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Families, mostly. Folk who lost each other on the road and think the water's where they'll find each other again. Sometimes they're right.",
        "He looks at your purse, then at the river, and shakes his head. Not for any coin. I've pulled enough people out of it.",
        "Aye. Go on down. Ask at the fires — that's what they're for."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "mark": {
            "ferry": "asked"
          }
        },
        {
          "mark": {
            "ferry": "refused"
          }
        },
        {}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "riv-log",
      "type": "challenge",
      "x": 3300,
      "kind": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "riv-relic-2",
      "type": "interest",
      "x": 3800,
      "reward": {
        "artifacts": 1,
        "gold": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "riv-boars",
      "type": "creature",
      "x": 4600,
      "kind": "boar",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "riv-corran",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 5000,
      "speaker": "Corran",
      "lines": [
        "I know that walk. I'd know it in the dark.",
        "I told you I'd not forget. Sit — there's stew and it's hot, which is more than this camp usually manages.",
        "Listen. There's a family been at the low fires eleven days. Asking everyone who comes down the road after a child. I told them people do come down that road. I told them it happens."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Where are the low fires?",
        "Eat first"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Along the water, past the last of the tents. You'll see them from the rise.",
        "He puts the bowl in your hands and does not let you refuse it. Eat, he says. Then go. They'll not have moved."
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "mark": {
            "family_sign": "lowfires"
          },
          "health": 20
        },
        {
          "mark": {
            "family_sign": "lowfires"
          },
          "health": 30,
          "gold": 15
        }
      ],
      "requiresAny": [
        "@corran=saved",
        "fst-wounded=0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "riv-relic-3",
